and stays[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]passing across repeated runs: the bead-backend and test-matrix jobs[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stop tripping the pytest state write guard, and the visual-test job[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]stops failing on timing-dependent PNG snapshot captures. Both fixes[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]address the underlying causes; neither is worked around by [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]regenerating goldens or by loosening the exact-equality PNG [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]comparison.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fix_ci_bead_isolation_and_visual_flakes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore bead-store isolation for the epic-work CLI tests[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bead-fix[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-fix: give the unisolated epic-work CLI test the project_dir fixture[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its siblings use, and close the same latent gap in the neighbouring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contention repro harness and load-robust visual convergence[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-converge[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-converge: build a repeatable contention harness that reproduces [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the visual snapshot flakes locally, then make render-convergence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detection robust to CPU starvation instead of relying on a wall-clock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]quiet period.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Guarantee the compared PNG frame is the converged frame[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after visual-converge[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-capture: eliminate the gap between the frame that convergence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proved stable and the frame that is actually rasterized and compared, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then fix whatever residual per-test races the hardened harness still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exposes.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Confirm CI is green and durable[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bead-fix, visual-capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-verify: prove on real CI that every job passes and that the visual [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]job is no longer flaky across repeated runs, within the existing job [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]timeout budgets.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-9y","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-9y.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-09b529c63e29b0519210624e779e4de1","started_at":"2026-07-27T11:24:00.042886+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785169486,"sha":"a947469eece2988bdfff48bd6ee40b5a9701172f","subject":"docs: record final visual contention baseline (sase-9y)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"c48e4d7e7329f94fb8cf57df018ebbe196bb9ff3eb4e84860ad2b2d1582c8807","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9y.land--code/chat.md","size_bytes":8898},"commits":{"digest":"448da59d6c027d3090605659e3fc4cb42b17ec0a74f082b5355d713a7043f60d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9y.land--code/commits.json","size_bytes":233},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9y.land--code/embedded_workf